What is the primary purpose of DNS?
 a: To translate hostnames into IP addresses
Which is NOT a type of DNS server?
 d: Firewall DNS server
Which query type allows the server to take full responsibility for finding the answer?
 b: Recursive
Which DNS record maps a hostname to an IP address?
 c: A
What is the function of a CNAME record?
 a: It maps a domain name to another domain name

Which DNS server handles extensions like .com and .org?
 b: Top-Level Domain (TLD) DNS server
Primary role of an authoritative DNS server?
 b: To store and provide final IP resolutions for domains
What does TTL (Time-To-Live) specify?
 a: The time after which the DNS record expires
Which best describes an iterative DNS query?
 b: The server refers the client to another DNS server instead of resolving it itself
Which protocol is used by DNS?
c: Both TCP and UDP
